  "worked_solution": "The general equation of forced harmonic motion with damping is\n\n$$\nm{y}^{\u2033}=-c{y}^{\u2032}-ky+F(t).\n$$\n\nSubstituting our values for $m,$ $k,$ $c$ and $F(t)$ gives\n\n$$\n3{y}^{\u2033}=-9{y}^{\u2032}-12y+15\\operatorname{sin}\u2061(t).\n$$\n\nSimplifying and rearranging the above equation, we get\n\n$$\n{y}^{\u2033}+3{y}^{\u2032}+4y=5\\operatorname{sin}\u2061(t).\n$$",
